      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "An information specialist searched the Cochrane Central Register of Controlled Trials (CENTRAL) in The Cochrane Library, Medical Literature Analysis and Retrieval System Online (MEDLINE Ovid), Excerpta Medica database (Embase Ovid), Latin American and Caribbean Health Sciences Literature (LILACS; Bireme), Science Citation Index Expanded (SCI-EXPANDED; Web of Science), Conference Proceedings Citation Index-Science (CPCI-S; Web of Science), BIOSIS (Web of Science), CINAHL (EBSCO host), Chinese Biomedical Literature Database (CBM), China Network Knowledge Information (CNKI), Chinese Science Journal Database (VIP), and Wafang Database to identify relevant trials.",
      "reason": "The authors list the names of the bibliographic databases and their platforms/interfaces (e.g., MEDLINE Ovid, Embase Ovid, CINAHL EBSCO host). However, they do not report the available coverage dates for these databases, only stating they searched from inception."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "To identify unpublished trials, we searched clinical trial registries (e.g., clinicaltrials.gov, clinicaltrialregister.eu, who.int/ictrp, chictr.org.cn) of Europe, USA, and China",
      "reason": "The authors name the clinical trial registries searched. No specific date restrictions are mentioned, implying no restrictions were applied."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "websites of pharmaceutical companies, websites of US Food and Drug Administration (FDA) and European Medicines Agency (EMA). We also searched the COVID-19 Study Registry [13] and the real-time dashboard of randomized trials [14]. We also searched preprint servers (bioRxiv, medRxiv) for unpublished trials.",
      "reason": "The authors name the websites and online sources searched. While specific URLs are not provided for all, the names are sufficient to identify the sources."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The authors did not report contacting specific organizations or manufacturers to identify studies; they searched websites of pharmaceutical companies and regulatory agencies instead."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e6",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "We contacted all trial authors to obtain individual patient data.",
      "reason": "The authors describe contacting trial authors to identify/obtain data."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e7",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "The reference lists of relevant trial publications were checked for any unidentified randomized clinical trials.",
      "reason": "The authors specify that reference lists of relevant trial publications were examined."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e8",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The authors do not report performing backward or forward citation searching."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e9",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The authors do not report consulting specific journals or conference proceedings beyond the databases already listed."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 95
}

